{"availability":"available","full":"m-rishab/Diet-and-workout-Recommendation","name":"Diet-and-workout-Recommendation","description":"Elevate your health journey with our Diet & Workout Recommendation System on Google Gemini Pro! Personalized suggestions based on age, sex, height, weight, region, dietary preferences, allergies, and health conditions. Optimize your well-being effortlessly!","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":12,"forks":4,"created":"2024-01-14T07:21:46Z","updated":"2026-09-15T17:40:51Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://diet-and-workout-recommendation-using-app-gemini-pro.streamlit.app/","topics":["apikey-authentication","genrative-ai","google-gemini-ai","langchain","python3","streamlit"],"demo":"https://diet-and-workout-recommendation-using-app-gemini-pro.streamlit.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:22:55.377Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:22:55.377Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:22:55.377Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.434Z","stars":12,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:22:55.377Z","stars":12,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Note: The repository name \"(using-Google-Gemini-pro)\" is legacy — this app is powered by NVIDIA NIM (nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b via ChatNVIDIA/LangChain), not Google Gemini. See Legacy notebook for the original Gemini demo.","Elevate your health journey with our Diet & Workout Recommendation System powered by NVIDIA NIM (Nemotron 120B)! Personalized suggestions based on age, gender, height, weight, region, dietary preferences, allergies, and health conditions. Optimize your well-being effortlessly!"],"features":["Personalized recommendations: Generates diet (breakfast/lunch/dinner) and workout plans customized to age, gender, weight, height, region/state, diet type, allergies and medical conditions.","AI-powered insights: Uses NVIDIA NIM (nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b) with a strict-JSON prompt and local safety guardrails (allergy/medical constraints + medical disclaimer) — output is parsed and normalized before…","Local health math: BMI, BMR (Mifflin-St Jeor), TDEE (×1.55) and daily calorie target computed locally (app/backend.py:computemetrics), not by the LLM.","Modern UI: Built with Streamlit — sidebar form, 6 tabs (Meals / Restaurants / Workouts / Weekly Split / Insights / Ask the Coach), save/load and clear-history flows.","Interactive charts: BMI bar/gauge, macro targets and BMI-over-time trend via Plotly."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/m-rishab/Diet-and-workout-Recommendation/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"98eb8f34093a73bdab918a9f98ae581e3f9054c1df66ff71e2a224c955f5cd24","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.512Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.512Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Note: The repository name \"(using-Google-Gemini-pro)\" is legacy — this app is powered by NVIDIA NIM (nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b via ChatNVIDIA/LangChain), not Google Gemini. See Legacy notebook for the original Gemini demo.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/m-rishab/Diet-and-workout-Recommendation/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Keyless images: Real dish/exercise photos are searched at runtime through DuckDuckGo (primary, via ddgs) with Bing and Wikimedia Commons as fallbacks — no image API keys needed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/m-rishab/Diet-and-workout-Recommendation/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Obtain a NVIDIA NIM API key (free credits available).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/m-rishab/Diet-and-workout-Recommendation/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"98eb8f34093a73bdab918a9f98ae581e3f9054c1df66ff71e2a224c955f5cd24","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/m-rishab/Diet-and-workout-Recommendation/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.513Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"20